<sideBySide width="45%">
  <graph size="small" xmin="-4" xmax="4" ymin="-4" ymax="4" identicalAxisScales showNavigation="false" fixed="true" grid="true">
    <shortDescription>The slope field of dy/dt = 0.5*(t-y)</shortDescription>
    <slopeField variables="t y" lineWidth="2">0.5*(t-y)</slopeField>
    <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
    <yLabel><m>y</m></yLabel>
    <label anchor="(-3.5,3.5)">A</label>
  </graph>

  <graph size="small" xmin="-4" xmax="4" ymin="-4" ymax="4" identicalAxisScales showNavigation="false" fixed="true" grid="true">
  <shortDescription>The slope field of dy/dt = 0.5*t*y</shortDescription>
  <slopeField variables="t y" lineWidth="2">0.5*t*y</slopeField>
  <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
  <yLabel><m>y</m></yLabel>
    <label anchor="(-3.5,3.5)">B</label>
</graph>
</sideBySide>
<sideBySide width="45%">
  <graph size="small" xmin="-4" xmax="4" ymin="-4" ymax="4" identicalAxisScales showNavigation="false" fixed="true" grid="true">
    <shortDescription>The slope field of dy/dt = 0.5*t/y</shortDescription>
    <slopeField variables="t y" lineWidth="2">0.5*t/y</slopeField>
    <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
    <yLabel><m>y</m></yLabel>
    <label anchor="(-3.5,3.5)">C</label>
  </graph>

  <graph size="small" xmin="-4" xmax="4" ymin="-4" ymax="4" identicalAxisScales showNavigation="false" fixed="true" grid="true">
  <shortDescription>The slope field of dy/dt = 0.5*(t+y)</shortDescription>
  <slopeField variables="t y" lineWidth="2">0.5*(t+y)</slopeField>
  <xLabel><m>t</m></xLabel>
  <yLabel><m>y</m></yLabel>
    <label anchor="(-3.5,3.5)">D</label>
</graph>
</sideBySide>

<p>
  Match each of the four slope fields above <mdash/> A, B, C, and D, as labeled in the upper left corner of the plot <mdash/> to their corresonding differential equation from among the following choices.  For each equation below, choose either the corresponding letter (A, B, C, or D) or <q>none</q> if there is no slope field that matches the equation.
</p>

<p>
  <choiceInput name="E3" inline>
    <shortDescription>A, B, C, D, none</shortDescription><choice>?</choice><choice>A</choice><choice>B</choice><choice>C</choice><choice>D</choice><choice>none</choice></choiceInput><m>\hspace{.1in} \frac{dy}{dt} = 0.5 \frac{t}{y} </m>
</p>
<p>
  <choiceInput name="E1" inline><shortDescription>A, B, C, D, none</shortDescription><choice>?</choice><choice>A</choice><choice>B</choice><choice>C</choice><choice>D</choice><choice>none</choice></choiceInput><m> \hspace{.1in} \frac{dy}{dt} = -0.5(t-y)</m>
</p>
<p>
  <choiceInput name="E5" inline><shortDescription>A, B, C, D, none</shortDescription><choice>?</choice><choice>A</choice><choice>B</choice><choice>C</choice><choice>D</choice><choice>none</choice></choiceInput><m> \hspace{.1in} \frac{dy}{dt} = 0.5(t-y) </m>
</p>
<p>
  <choiceInput name="E6" inline><shortDescription>A, B, C, D, none</shortDescription><choice>?</choice><choice>A</choice><choice>B</choice><choice>C</choice><choice>D</choice><choice>none</choice></choiceInput><m>\hspace{.1in} \frac{dy}{dt} = 0.5(t+y) </m>
</p>
<p>
  <choiceInput name="E2" inline><shortDescription>A, B, C, D, none</shortDescription><choice>?</choice><choice>A</choice><choice>B</choice><choice>C</choice><choice>D</choice><choice>none</choice></choiceInput><m>\hspace{.1in}\frac{dy}{dt} = 0.5 t y </m>
</p>
<p>
  <choiceInput name="E4" inline><shortDescription>A, B, C, D, none</shortDescription><choice>?</choice><choice>A</choice><choice>B</choice><choice>C</choice><choice>D</choice><choice>none</choice></choiceInput><m>\hspace{.1in} \frac{dy}{dt} = -0.5 t y </m>
</p>

<p>
  <answer matchPartial><award><when>
    $E1.selectedIndices=6 and $E2.selectedIndices=3 and $E3.selectedIndices=4 and $E4.selectedIndices=6 and $E5.selectedIndices=2 and $E6.selectedIndices=5
  </when></award></answer>
</p>
